  "what has he shipped on azure?": {
    "answer": "He shipped a document intelligence assistant on Azure for an enterprise consulting client. The assistant is a LangGraph agent exposing 14 tools for document question answering, cross-document comparison, and template-driven generation. It uses hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval with Cohere re-ranking, PII and entity redaction, and LLM-as-a-Judge evaluations to guard against hallucinations. The system streams FastAPI endpoints over Server-Sent Events to a React single-page app and stores metadata in Azure Blob Storage. It links clients, projects, and technologies in a Cosmos DB Gremlin knowledge graph. The deployment runs from ingestion through production on Azure.",
