  "what broke in production and how did he find it?": {
    "answer": "He found a silent failure in LangChain's deepagents SDK where a code path reported success while discarding an error, a defect that static analysis missed because it lacked contextual awareness. The issue manifested as a production defect with no exception or stack trace, which he identified by reading the system closely enough to see where it contradicted itself. He wrote up the defect precisely enough that a maintainer shipped the fix in 57 hours.",
